; ============================================================================
; CK_GOLD_COMBO  =  FIX09 + DTREND on ONE $5000 account (GFT 5K 2-step).
; Runs both strategies together, each with its own magic, plus a MASTER
; whole-account guard (static 8% halt + 5% daily-loss stop) = GFT-safe.
;
; ---- HOW TO TEST (MT5 Strategy Tester) ----
;   Expert   : CK_GOLD_COMBO
;   Symbol   : XAUUSD
;   Timeframe: M15         <-- IMPORTANT: FIX09 uses the chart TF for entries
;   Model    : "1 minute OHLC" (fast)  OR  "Every tick based on real ticks" (honest)
;   Deposit  : 5000 USD
;   Leverage : 1:100
;   Dates    : your window (my combined test = 2025.09.02 -> 2026.09.02)
;
; ---- MY PYTHON-MERGED RESULT (Model-1 fast, last 1yr) for reference ----
;   Combined net +255% ($12,762), PF 1.52, 332 trades, static DD 0% (never
;   below $5000 because the Sep->Feb trend built a cushion first), worst day
;   -4.31%. HONEST WARNING: FIX09 bleeds in chop -- if you START in a chop
;   stretch (e.g. Mar-Aug 2026) FIX09 alone did -33% on a fresh $5k = would
;   blow the 10% static. The master guard here caps that at 8%. Real-tick is
;   lower/harsher than Model-1. TEST BOTH MODELS and several start dates.
;
;   To see each strategy alone: set Combo_EnableFIX09=false (DTREND only) or
;   Combo_EnableDTREND=false (FIX09 only).
; ============================================================================
